# What Docker builds may never see (step 19a, ADR-54). The builds use the repository root as their
# "context" (the files they can copy from); anything listed here is not even sent to the builder.

# Secrets and personal files
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
certs/
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
handbook/
docs/MEMORY.md

# Version control and editors
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Build output and installed packages: the images build their own
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/logs/
*.log
